    {
      "id": "outline_values_component_split_rationale",
      "label": "Outline component-split design: rationale — websockets and BullMQ worker/cron cannot run standalone (websockets has no WEBSOCKETS_URL, isolated worker/cron grows memory unbounded), so they ride inside web; cron duplication across web replicas is safe because BullMQ repeatable jobs are idempotent; no StatefulSets because all state lives in Postgres, Redis and S3; collaboration >1 replica requires REDIS_COLLABORATION_URL",
      "file_type": "concept",
